IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0007.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 CLNT-AGE           PIC 9(3).
    05 TXN-AMT            PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 ORIG-CTRY          PIC X(2).
       88 ORIG-IS-XE VALUE 'XE'.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 RVW-IND            PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 RVW-REVIEW-NEEDED VALUE 'Y'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM MINOR-TXN-CHECK
    PERFORM HIGH-RISK-REGION
    DISPLAY "RVW-IND=" RVW-IND
    STOP RUN.
MINOR-TXN-CHECK.
    IF CLNT-AGE < 18 AND TXN-AMT > 8000
        SET RVW-REVIEW-NEEDED TO TRUE
    END-IF.
HIGH-RISK-REGION.
    IF TXN-AMT > 60000 AND ORIG-IS-XE
        SET RVW-REVIEW-NEEDED TO TRUE
        CALL 'FRDALERT' USING INPUT-AREA
            ON EXCEPTION CONTINUE
        END-CALL
    END-IF.
